    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenging subject for me, but I appreciate its logical structure. While it's not my favorite topic, I recognize its importance in problem-solving and analytical thinking. My background in art and philosophy makes me approach math from a more abstract perspective, which sometimes helps me see patterns others might miss.",
